003	LEV	026	009	“‘Ani fuula tolaadhaan gara keessan ilaalee akka isin hortanii baayʼattan nan godha; kakuu isin wajjin qabus nan jabeessa.
003	LEV	026	010	Isin midhaan bara darbee nyaachaa utuu inni gombisaa keessaa hin dhumin, midhaan haaraadhaaf iddoo qopheessuuf jettanii midhaan bara darbee sana gad baaftu.
