010	2SA	023	028	Zalmoon nama Ahooʼaa, Maharaayi nama Netoofaa,
010	2SA	023	029	Heeled ilma Baʼanaa nama Netoofaa, gosa Beniyaam keessaa Iitaayi ilma Riibaay namicha Gibeʼaa,
010	2SA	023	030	Benaayaa nama Phiraatoon Hidaay namicha sululoota Gaʼaash,
010	2SA	023	031	Abii-Alboon namicha biyya Arbaa, Azmaawet nama Barhuum,
