013	1CH	012	023	Baayʼinni namoota lolaaf hidhatanii akkuma Waaqayyo dubbatee turetti mootummaa Saaʼol gara Daawitiitti dabarsuudhaaf jedhanii Daawit bira gara Kebroonii dhufanii kanneenii dha:
