013	1CH	012	030	namoonni Efreem warri lolatti ciccimoo fi balbala isaanii keessatti bebeekamoo taʼan 20,800;
013	1CH	012	031	walakkaa gosa Minaasee keessaa namoonni Daawitin mootii gochuudhaaf maqaan isaanii galmaaʼee dhufan 18,000;
