013	1CH	014	011	Kanaafuu Daawitii fi namoonni isaa gara Baʼaal Pheraaziim ol baʼan; achittis isaan moʼate. Innis, “Akkuma bishaan mana isaa cabsee yaaʼu sana Waaqni harka kootiin diinota koo cabsee baʼeera” jedhe. Kanaafuu iddoon sun Baʼaal Pheraaziim jedhamee waamame.
013	1CH	014	012	Filisxeemonni waaqota isaanii tolfamoo achitti ni dhiisan; Daawit immoo akka waaqonni sun ibiddaan gubaman ni ajaje.
